Turing prefill attention: an fp16 path that fits 64 KiB of shared memory.

Ampere's tile does not fit on SM75, so this adds
`v1/attention/ops/turing_prefill_attn.py`: fp16 Q/K/V with fp32 accumulation, a
workspace for the packed KV, and the per-(token, head) int8/int4 scales and zero
points folded in after each dot. Single-request causal prefill only; other
dtypes, and the drafter's sliding-window layers, keep their existing paths.

